    "title": "14  Excel Interview Bible",
    "section": "20.1 Business Task",
    "text": "20.1 Business Task\nRevenue by City.\n\n20.1.1 Steps\nInsert\n→ Pivot Table\nFields.\nRows:\n\ncity\n\nValues:\n\nSum of amount\n\n\n\n20.1.2 Result\n\n\n\nCity\nRevenue\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n£120,000\n\n\nManchester\n£87,000\n\n\n\n\n\n20.1.3 Explain It (B2)\n\nThe Pivot Table automatically groups cities and calculates total revenue.\n\nMemory Hook.\nPivot means summarise.",
