    "section": "16.1 Dashboards • Business Cases • Mock Interview • 30-Minute Challenge",
    "text": "16.1 Dashboards • Business Cases • Mock Interview • 30-Minute Challenge\nWelcome to the final Excel sprint.\nEverything you’ve learned now comes together in one realistic hiring assessment.\nImagine you’re interviewing for a Junior Data Analyst role at a UK company.\nThe interviewer sends one message.\n\n“You have 30 minutes.”\n\nYour goal isn’t just to use Excel.\nYour goal is to make business decisions with data.",
